  "steps": [
    "Heat the oil in a pan and add the mustard seeds, cumin seeds and hing.",
    "Add the potato cubes with a pinch of salt and sauté for 3 minutes.",
    "Add the brinjal, turmeric, chilli powder and coriander powder and mix well.",
    "Add the chopped tomato, remaining salt and sugar, and sprinkle 2-3 tablespoons of water.",
    "Cover and cook on low heat for 15 minutes, stirring occasionally, until the vegetables are fork tender.",
    "Stir in garam masala and coriander leaves and cook uncovered for 2 minutes."
  ]
